{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的亲近让他安心享受当下，可他也知道，日子不会因为此刻舒服就停下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心享受当下\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他提醒自己，喜欢不等于对方欠他回应，不必反复确认对方心意，也很高兴自己能真心对人好。\",\n      \"key\": \"欠他回应\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时想让喜欢更明显地流露出来，随后又把心意收住一点，仍照常自在地亲近对方。\",\n      \"key\": \"收住一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那时他真觉得，只要能一直这样自然地亲近，就已经够了，不必再向对方多要什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"已经够了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并回指\",\n      \"why\": \"R5中说不清顾虑的部分已被S01-2具体化，不再重复。把暂缓安排未来的做法转为专心享受眼前相处的效果，并补上舒服的当下与时间仍在流逝的并存。S01-3解释他为何能暂留当下，S01-4则让眼前的好带上舍不得的意味。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把不向对方索取回应、不反复确认心意、仍愿意真心付出，以及对自己能做到的高兴，收进一个具体的自我提醒。删去重复的安心说明和把个人体验说成普遍道理的句子，保留他对自己能够这样付出的满意。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"补上热切一时冒头、随后又收住的局部心理过程。前段对显露在意、改变相处的顾虑仍在起作用，因此他既想让喜欢流露得更多，又没有完全放开。原因来自他已有的顾虑，而不是音乐本身的起伏。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他当时真觉得自然亲近已经够了这一关键判断，使后段R14对这份满足的动摇仍有真实前提。这里的够了是他对当时相处的判断，不代表他没有舍不得，也不代表他已经消除了不安。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "089ee5a2-1f25-4ec9-9c04-38b976dc6ec0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T060548712890Z", "elapsed_seconds": 605.766, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:15:54.484264+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37783be0118b36ee4edf6e6111c57994ea8903bf293b6dd31df5da04aa0c3609", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T060548712890Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dfd44b8f53041d14bb4d0a98